  m2["<b>Measure again</b><br/>1,000 searches = 2 queries (40 with 40 rooms)<br/>999 hits; p95 1.13 ms / 1.22 ms<br/>busy sale: 98 % hits, 1 miss per booking"]
  next["<b>The next bottleneck</b><br/>POST /reservations: 3 exact queries per booking,<br/>cannot be cached; the P03 race is still there<br/>-> L05 + P09"]
